  "For an album, switch the camera to Album pages.": "45744823130e",
  "Leave the prints where they are: there’s no need to take them out.": "f5d2767164f3",
  "If the plastic film makes glare, peel it back.": "f25086960531",
  "Get as much of the page in as you can, with a little space round it. A table round the edge is fine.": "c30ea859ef65",
  "Open the page and tap a photo on it.": "dd377d99d7c8",
  "StoryPrints finds its edges and shows you the crop. Adjust it if you need to, then tap Apply Crop.": "8be2df5eda80",
  "Each photo you take gets a green box with a number.": "3eb561c93667",
  "Tap inside a green box to crop that photo again.": "36929f4fa15f",
  "Took an album page as a print? Open it and tap the ⋮ menu at the top right.": "e023549ad99b",
